{"id": "10th-u7-q046", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "standard", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "10", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_7", "lesson_id": "sitragal_oli", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "nesamony_profession_status", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "தெற்கெல்லைப் போராட்டத்தின் கதாநாயகனான மார்ஷல் ஏ. நேசமணி அவர்கள் தொழிலால் எத்தகைய ஆளுமையாக விளங்கினார்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "பத்திரிகையாளர்", "B": "வழக்கறிஞர் மற்றும் நாடாளுமன்ற உறுப்பினர்", "C": "மருத்துவர்", "D": "வணிகர்"}, "explanation": "மார்ஷல் நேசமணி அவர்கள் நாகர்கோவில் பார் அசோசியேஷன் தலைவராகவும், சட்டமன்ற, நாடாளுமன்ற உறுப்பினராகவும் பணியாற்றிய தலைசிறந்த வழக்கறிஞர் ஆவார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "By profession, what prominent public role did Marshal A. Nesamony hold during the border movements?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Journalist", "B": "Advocate (Lawyer) and Member of Parliament", "C": "Physician", "D": "Merchant"}, "explanation": "Marshal Nesamony was an eminent advocate and parliamentarian."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "10", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 153, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "10th Tamil, Unit 7, Page 153", "ur