{"id": "10th-u7-q061", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "standard", "difficulty": "easy", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "10", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_7", "lesson_id": "aer_pudhithaa", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "poem_lines_meaning", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "\"முதல் மழை விழுந்தது... நாளும் புதிது நன்செய் புதிது ஏர் புதிதா? அன்று...\" - இவ்வடிகளில் கவிஞர் வெளிப்படுத்தும் மையக் கருத்து என்ன?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "ஏர் கருவி பழையதே ஆயினும், ஒவ்வொரு ஆண்டும் புதிதாகத் தொடங்கும் உழவுப் பணி புத்துணர்ச்சியும் புது நம்பிக்கையும் தருகிறது", "B": "ஏர் பழுதடைந்துவிட்டது", "C": "மழை பெய்யவில்லை", "D": "விவசாயத்தை நிறுத்த வேண்டும்"}, "explanation": "பழைய ஏர்க்கருவியாக இருந்தாலும், உழவுத் தொழில் தலைமுறை தலைமுறையாகப் புதுப்பிக்கப்படும் மனித வாழ்வின் ஆதார ஊற்று என்பதை உணர்த்துகிறது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What poetic truth is captured by the verse: \"First rain fell... The day is new, wetland is new, is the plough new? No...\"?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Though the wooden plough is ancient, every seasonal beginning of tilling infuses fresh vitality and hope into humanity", "B": "The plough is broken", "C": "Rains failed", "D": "Abandon farming"}, "explanation": "Ploughing renews the timeless covenant between earth, farmer, and vitality."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "10", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 156, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "10th Tamil, Unit 7, Page 156", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["ஏர் புதிதா", "கவிதை வரிகள்", "புது நம்பிக்கை"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "10th-u7-q062", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "standard", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "10", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_7", "lesson_id": "aer_pudhithaa", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "bulls_hump_strength", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "கவிதையில் மாடுகளின் வீரம் மற்றும் உழைப்பின் கம்பீரத்தை விவரிக்கக் கவிஞர் குறிப்பிடும் உடல் உறுப்பு எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "மாடுகளின் வால்", "B": "காளைகளின் திமில் (முறுக்கேறும் திமில்)", "C": "மாடுகளின் காதுகள்", "D": "மாடுகளின் கண்கள்"}, "explanation": "கவிதையில்: \"காளைகளின் திமில் முறுக்கேறுகிறது... நிலத்தைப் பிளந்து உழுக...\" என்று காளைகளின் திமில் பலத்தைப் போற்றுகிறார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which physical anatomy of the tilling bulls is emphasized by the poet to portray muscular vigor?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Bulls' tail", "B": "Muscular humps of the bulls (Thimil murukkaerugirathu)", "C": "Bulls' ears", "D": "Bulls' eyes"}, "explanation": "The tensed muscular hump (Thimil) embodies agrarian strength."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "10", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 156, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "10th Tamil, Unit 7, Page 1