{"id": "10th-u7-q070", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "standard", "difficulty": "easy", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "10", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_7", "lesson_id": "meikkeerthi", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "historical_value_inscriptions", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "மெய்க்கீர்த்திகள் வரலாற்று ஆய்வாளர்களுக்கு எவ்வகையில் பேருதவியாக விளங்குகின்றன?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "கற்பனைக் கதைகளை அறிய", "B": "மன்னர்களின் உண்மைப் பெயர்கள், ஆட்சியாண்டுகள், போர் வெற்றிகள் மற்றும் சமூக நிலைகளைத் துல்லியமாக அறிய உதவும் நம்பகமான வரலாற்று ஆவணங்களாக விளங்குவதால்", "C": "ஜோதிடத்தை அறிய", "D": "மருத்துவம் கற்க"}, "explanation": "மெய்க்கீர்த்திகள் எவ்வித இடைச்செருகலும் இன்றி காலத்தால் அழியாமல் கல்லில் பொறிக்கப்பட்ட முதல்நிலை வரலாற்றுச் சான்றுகளாகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Why are Meikkeerthi inscriptions invaluable for scientific historical research?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "To study myths", "B": "They serve as unadulterated primary documentary stone records of royal reigns, regnal years, victories, and social conditions", "C": "To cast horoscopes", "D": "For medical lore"}, "explanation": "They constitute unadulterated primary lithic records of dynastic history."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "10", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 159, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "10th Tamil, Unit 7, Page 159", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["மெய்க்கீர்த்தி", "வரலாற்று ஆவணம்", "கல்வெட்டு மதிப்பு"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "10th-u7-q071", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "standard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "10", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_7", "lesson_id": "meikkeerthi", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "rajaraja_two_titles", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "இரண்டாம் இராசராச சோழன் கல்வெட்டுகளில் காணப்படும் அவனது சிறப்புப் பட்டப் பெயர்கள் எவை?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "மதுரை கொண்டான், ஈழம் கொண்டான்", "B": "சுங்கம் தவிர்த்த சோழன்", "C": "கோப்பரகேசரி, திருபுவன சக்கரவர்த்தி", "D": "கடாரம் கொண்டான்"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் குறிப்பு: இரண்டாம் இராசராச சோழன் \"கோப்பரகேசரி\", \"திருபுவன சக்கரவர்த்தி\" என்ற சிறப்புப் பட்டங்களைப் பெற்றிருந்தான்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which sovereign imperial titles were borne by Rajaraja Chola II in his epigraphs?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Madurai Kondan, Eelam Kondan", "B": "Sungam Thavirtha Cholan", "C": "Kopparakesari and Thirubhuvana Chakravarthi", "D": "Kadaram Kondan"}, "explanation": "He was titled Kopparakesari and Thirubhuvana Chakravarthi."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "10", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 159, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "10th Tamil, Unit 7, Page 159", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["மெய்க்கீர்த்தி", "கோப்பரகேசரி", "திருபுவன சக்கரவர்த்தி"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "10th-u7-q072", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "standard", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "10", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_7", "lesson_id": "meikkeerthi", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "oodaigal_kalangina", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "\"ஓடைகளே கலங்கின; மக்களின் உள்ளங்கள் ஒருபோதும் கலங்கவில்லை\" - இதில் ஓடைகள் கலங்கியதற்குக் காரணம் என்ன?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "கழிவுநீர் கலந்தது", "B": "மழைநீர் வரவில்லை", "C": "பூச்சிகள் விழுந்தன", "D": "செழிப்பான புதிய புதுவெள்ளம் பாய்ந்து வந்ததால் ஓடை நீர் கலங்கியது; துன்பத்தால் மக்கள் மனம் கலங்கவில்லை"}, "explanation": "புதுப்புனல் பாய்ந்ததால் ஓடைகளில் நீர் கலங்கியதே தவிர, நாட்டில் எந்தக் குடிமகனின் மனமும் துன்பத்தால் கலங்கவில்லை எனப் பாடுகிறார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In the panegyric \"Streams alone were stirred/turbid, but no human hearts were troubled\", why were the streams turbid?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Polluted drainage", "B": "Drought", "C": "Insects", "D": "Fresh, gushing monsoon freshets stirred the mountain streams; no subject's heart was ever stirred by sorrow"}, "explanation": "Torrents of fresh river water stirred the streams, but subjects' hearts were serene."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Ser