{"id": "10th-u7-q073", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "standard", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "10", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_7", "lesson_id": "meikkeerthi", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "horse_scarred_not_people", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "\"மா மட்டுமே வடுப்பட்டது; மக்களில் எவரும் வடுப்படவில்லை\" - இவ்வடியில் \"மா\" என்பது குறிக்கும் விலங்கு எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "குதிரை (பரி / அசுவம்)", "B": "யானை", "C": "சிங்கம்", "D": "பசு மாடு"}, "explanation": "மா என்பது குதிரையைக் குறிக்கும். போர்ப்பயிற்சியின் போது குதிரையின் மீது மட்டுமே சாட்டை வடுப் பட்டதே அன்றி, கொடுங்கோல் அடக்குமுறையால் மனிதர்கள் எவரும் காயமடையவில்லை."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In the phrase \"Maa mattumae vaduppattathu\" (Maa alone received weals/scars), what animal does \"Maa\" denote?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Horse (Kuthirai / Pari)", "B": "Elephant", "C": "Lion", "D": "Cow"}, "explanation": "Maa denotes a warhorse which bore riding weals, while no citizen was ever tortured."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "10", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 158, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "10th Tamil, Unit 7, Page 158", "u