{"id": "10th-u7-q074", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "standard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "10", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_7", "lesson_id": "meikkeerthi", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "forests_pul_people_not_pul", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "\"காடுகளே புல் கொண்டன; மாந்தர் எவரும் புல் அல்லர்\" - இதில் \"புல்\" என்னும் சொல்லின் இருவேறு பொருள்கள் யாவை?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "மரம், செடி", "B": "புல் (தாவரம்) மற்றும் புல் (அற்பமானவர் / இழிந்தவர்)", "C": "பறவை, விலங்கு", "D": "மண், கல்"}, "explanation": "காடுகள் மட்டுமே புற்களைக் கொண்டிருந்தன; நாட்டில் வாழ்ந்த மாந்தர் எவருமே அற்பமானவர்களாக (புல்லர்களாக) வாழவில்லை; அனைவரும் பெருமைமிக்க சான்றோராக வாழ்ந்தனர்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In \"Kaadugalae pul kondana; maanthar evarum pul allar\", what are the two punning meanings of \"Pul\"?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Tree and shrub", "B": "Grass vegetation (in forests) and Petty/worthless persons (in society)", "C": "Bird and beast", "D": "Soil and stone"}, "explanation": "Forests bore grass (Pul), but no citizen was petty or low (Pul)."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "10", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 158, "