{"id": "10th-u7-q142", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "standard", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "10", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_7", "lesson_id": "purapporul_ilakkanam", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "vetchi_and_karanthai", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "போர் தொடங்குவதற்கு முன்பாகப் பகை நாட்டின் ஆநிரைகளைக் கவர்தல் \"வெட்சித் திணை\" எனில், கவர்ந்து செல்லப்பட்ட தம் ஆநிரைகளை மீட்டு வருதல் எத்திணை?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "வஞ்சித் திணை", "B": "கரந்தைத் திணை", "C": "காஞ்சித் திணை", "D": "நொச்சித் திணை"}, "explanation": "ஆநிரையைக் கவர்தல் = வெட்சித் திணை (வெட்சிப் பூச் சூடுதல்); கவர்ந்து செல்லப்பட்ட பசுக்கூட்டங்களை மீட்டு வருதல் = கரந்தைத் திணை (கரந்தைப் பூச் சூடுதல்)."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "If capturing the enemy's cattle herds before war is Vetchi Thinai, what is retrieving the captured cattle called?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Vanji Thinai", "B": "Karanthai Thinai", "C": "Kanchi Thinai", "D": "Nochi Thinai"}, "explanation": "Recovering the captured herds is Karanthai Thinai."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "10", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 168, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "10th Tamil, Unit 7, Page 168", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["புறப்பொருள் இலக்கணம்", "கரந்தைத் திணை", "ஆநிரை மீட்டல்"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "10th-u7-q143", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "standard", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "10", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_7", "lesson_id": "purapporul_ilakkanam", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "vanji_and_kanchi", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "மண்ணாசை காரணமாகப் பகை நாட்டின் மீது போருக்குப் படையெடுத்துச் செல்லுதல் \"வஞ்சித் திணை\" எனில், தன் நாட்டைக் காக்க எதிர்த்துப் போரிடுதல் எத்திணை?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "உழிஞைத் திணை", "B": "நொச்சித் திணை", "C": "காஞ்சித் திணை", "D": "வாகைத் திணை"}, "explanation": "நாட்டைக் கைப்பற்றப் படையெடுத்துச் செல்லுதல் = வஞ்சி; தன் நாட்டைப் பிடிக்க வரும் மாற்றரசனை எதிர்த்து நின்று தடுத்துப் போரிடல் = காஞ்சித் திணை."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "If invading an enemy realm out of territorial ambition is Vanji Thinai, what is defending one's land against invaders called?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Uzhignai Thinai", "B": "Nochi Thinai", "C": "Kanchi Thinai", "D": "Vaagai Thinai"}, "explanation": "Defending the motherland against invaders is Kanchi Thinai."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "10", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 168, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "10th Tamil, Unit 7, Page 168", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["புறப்பொருள் இலக்கணம்", "காஞ்சித் திணை", "எதிர்த்துப் போரிடல்"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "10th-u7-q144", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "standard", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "10", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_7", "lesson_id": "purapporul_ilakkanam", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "nochi_and_uzhignai", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "தன் கோட்டையைக் காக்க உள்ளிருந்து போரிடுதல் \"நொச்சித் திணை\" எனில், பகைவனின் கோட்டையைக் கைப்பற்ற மதிலை வளைத்து முற்றுகையிடுதல் எத்திணை?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "தும்பைத் திணை", "B": "பாடாண் திணை", "C": "வாகைத் திணை", "D": "உழிஞைத் திணை"}, "explanation": "கோட்டையைக் காக்க உள்ளிருந்து போரிடுதல் = நொச்சி; கோட்டையைக் கைப்பற்ற மதிலைச் சுற்றி வளைத்தல் = உழிஞைத் திணை (உழிஞைப் பூவைச் சூடுவர்)."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "If defending the fort from within is Nochi Thinai, what is laying siege to the enemy fortress called?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Thumbai Thinai", "B": "Paadaan Thinai", "C": "Vaagai Thinai", "D": "Uzhignai Thinai (Siege warfare)"}, "explanation": "Storming and sieging a fortress is Uzhignai Thinai."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "10", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 168, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "10th Tamil, Unit 7, Page 168", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["புறப்பொருள் இலக்கணம்", "உழிஞைத் திணை", "கோட்டை முற்றுகை"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "10th-u7-q145", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "standard", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "10", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_7", "lesson_id": "purapporul_ilakkanam", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "thumbai_and_vaagai", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "இரு நாட்டு மன்னர்களும் போர்க்களத்தில் நேருக்கு நேர் நின்று வீரத்தோடு போரிடுதல் \"தும்பைத் திணை\" எனில், போரில் வெற்றி பெற்ற மன்னன் சூடும் பூ மற்றும் திணை எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "வாகைப் பூ - வாகைத் திணை (வாகை = வெற்றி)", "B": "வெட்சிப் பூ - வெட்சித் திணை", "C": "கரந்தைப் பூ - கரந்தைத் திணை", "D": "வஞ்சிப் பூ - வஞ்சித் திணை"}, "explanation": "போரில் வெற்றி பெற்ற அரசன் வாகைப் பூவைச் சூடி தன் வெற்றியைக் கொண்டாடுவது \"வாகைத் திணை\" ஆகும். வாகை என்றாலே வெற்றி என்று பொருள்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "If two adversarial armies clash face-to-face in pitch combat in Thumbai Thinai, what flower and thinai celebrate triumph?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Vaagai flower - Vaagai Thinai (Vaagai = Victory)", "B": "Vetchi flower", "C": "Karanthai flower", "D": "Vanji flower"}, "explanation": "Vaagai Thinai celebrates triumphal victory in battle."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "10", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 169, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "10th Tamil, Unit 7, Page 169", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["புறப்பொருள் இலக்கணம்", "வாகைத் திணை", "வெற்றி வாகை"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "10th-u7-q146", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "standard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "10", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_7", "lesson_id": "purapporul_ilakkanam", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "paadaan_thinai_derivation", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "\"பாடாண் திணை\" என்னும் சொல்லைப் பிரிக்கும் முறை மற்றும் அதன் பொருள் யாது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "பாட்டு + ஆண் + திணை = பாட்டு பாடும் ஆண்", "B": "பாடு + ஆண் + திணை = பாடப்படும் தகுதியுடைய ஓர் ஆண்மகனின் புகழ், வீரம், கொடை முதலானவற்றை ஆராய்ந்து பாடுதல்", "C": "பாடம் + ஆண் + திணை = பாடம் படிக்கும் ஆண்", "D": "படை + ஆண் + திணை = படை நடத்தும் ஆண்"}, "explanation": "பாடாண் திணை = பாடு + ஆண் + திணை. பாடப்படும் தகுதியுடைய ஓர் தலைவனின் புகழ், வீரம், கொடை, கல்வி முதலான பண்புகளைப் போற்றிப் பாடுவது பாடாண் திணை ஆகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "How is the compound term \"Paadaan Thinai\" parsed etymologically, and what does it denote?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Paattu + Aan + Thinai", "B": "Paadu + Aan + Thinai = Singing the exalted virtue, valor, munificence, and nobility of a worthy masculine hero", "C": "Paadam + Aan + Thinai", "D": "Padai + Aan + Thinai"}, "explanation": "Paadu + Aan + Thinai eulogizes the valor and munificence of a worthy hero."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "10", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 169, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "10th Tamil, Unit 7, Page 169", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["புறப்பொருள் இலக்கணம்", "பாடாண் திணை", "பாடு ஆண் திணை"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "10th-u7-q147", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "standard", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "10", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_7", "lesson_id": "purapporul_ilakkanam", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "podhuviyal_definition", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "வெட்சி முதல் பாடாண் வரை உள்ள திணைகளுக்குப் பொதுவானவற்றையும், அவற்றுள் கூறப்படாத விடுபட்ட செய்திகளையும் தொகுத்துக் கூறும் புறத்திணை எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "கைக்கிளை", "B": "பெருந்திணை", "C": "பொதுவியல் திணை", "D": "வாகைத் திணை"}, "explanation": "வெட்சி முதலிய புறத்திணைகளுக்குப் பொதுவான நெறிகளையும், அவற்றுள் விரித்துரைக்கப்படாத பிற அறங்களையும் தொகுத்துக் கூறுவது \"பொதுவியல் திணை\" ஆகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which Puratthinai synthesizes universal common principles across Vetchi to Paadaan while incorporating omitted ethics?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Kaikkilai", "B": "Perunthinai", "C": "Podhuviyal Thinai (General Anthology of Common Principles)", "D": "Vaagai Thinai"}, "explanation": "Podhuviyal codifies universal rules and omitted maxims across earlier martial thinais."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "10", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 169, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "10th Tamil, Unit 7, Page 169", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["புறப்பொருள் இலக்கணம்", "பொதுவியல் திணை", "வரையறை"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "10th-u7-q148", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "standard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "10", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_7", "lesson_id": "purapporul_ilakkanam", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "match_martial_thinais", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "கீழ்க்காணும் புறத்திணைகளையும் அவற்றுக்குரிய செயல்பாடுகளையும் சரியாகப் பொருத்துக:\n(a) வெட்சி - 1. கோட்டை காத்தல்\n(b) கரந்தை - 2. ஆநிரை கவர்தல்\n(c) நொச்சி - 3. மண்ணாசைப் படையெடுப்பு\n(d) வஞ்சி - 4. ஆநிரை மீட்டல்", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "(a)-1, (b)-2, (c)-3, (d)-4", "B": "(a)-4, (b)-2, (c)-1, (d)-3", "C": "(a)-3, (b)-4, (c)-2, (d)-1", "D": "(a)-2, (b)-4, (c)-1, (d)-3"}, "explanation": "வெட்சி = ஆநிரை கவர்தல் (2); கரந்தை = ஆநிரை மீட்டல் (4); நொச்சி = கோட்டை காத்தல் (1); வஞ்சி = மண்ணாசைப் படையெடுப்பு (3). சரியான வரிசை: 2, 4, 1, 3."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match the Puratthinais with their respective martial operations:\n(a) Vetchi - 1. Defending fortress\n(b) Karanthai - 2. Capturing cattle\n(c) Nochi - 3. Territorial invasion\n(d) Vanji - 4. Retrieving cattle", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "(a)-1, (b)-2, (c)-3, (d)-4", "B": "(a)-4, (b)-2, (c)-1, (d)-3", "C": "(a)-3, (b)-4, (c)-2, (d)-1", "D": "(a)-2, (b)-4, (c)-1, (d)-3"}, "explanation": "The correct matching order is 2, 4, 1, 3."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "boo